# HAVEN package list for the live chroot (Debian bookworm).
# One package per line. Verified present in Debian bookworm unless noted.
# Packages NOT in Debian (wazuh-agent, AWS CLI v2, OpenTofu, k3s, Burp Suite,
# BloodHound, Metasploit) are installed via config/archives/*.list.chroot
# third-party repos or by hook scripts, never listed here.

# --- Desktop (XFCE default) ---
task-xfce-desktop
lightdm

# --- Infrastructure and cloud automation ---
ansible
podman
python3-pipx
python3-boto3

# --- Blue team / defensive ---
suricata
zeek
tshark
auditd
clamav
clamav-daemon
openscap-scanner
ssg-debian

# --- Red team / auditing (Debian-packaged subset only) ---
nmap
hydra
nikto
sqlmap
gobuster
hashcat

# --- Utilities the layers depend on ---
curl
ca-certificates
git
vim
tmux
htop
net-tools
dnsutils
jq
python3-venv
chrony
nftables
